<section class="certification" id="certification">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title center">权威检测认证</h2>
    <p class="section-desc center">广东欣研检测 · 2026年04月07日 · 四维功效验证</p>
    
    <div class="cert-grid">
      <div class="cert-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="cert-icon">🧴</div>
        <h3>去屑功效</h3>
        <p class="cert-report">报告编号：XYJCR260328-108</p>
        <p>经第三方权威检测验证，有效减少头屑，让头皮恢复清爽洁净。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="cert-icon">💧</div>
        <h3>控油功效</h3>
        <p class="cert-report">报告编号：XYJCR260328-109</p>
        <p>经检测验证，有效平衡头皮水油，减少油腻感，发根更蓬松。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="cert-icon">🌿</div>
        <h3>滋养功效</h3>
        <p class="cert-report">报告编号：XYJCR260328-110</p>
        <p>经检测验证，草本精华有效滋养头皮，改善发质健康状态。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="cert-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>防断发功效</h3>
        <p class="cert-report">报告编号：XYJCR260328-111</p>
        <p>经检测验证，有效减少断发，强韧发丝，降低断裂与拉扯损伤。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.certification { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--bg-warm); }
.cert-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.cert-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  transition: all var(--transition);
}
.cert-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
}
.cert-icon {
  font-size: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.cert-card h3 {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--brand-dark);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}
.cert-report {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--brand);
  font-weight: 600;
  background: var(--brand-subtle);
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 3px 12px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.cert-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .cert-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .cert-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Certification",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Certification" }]
}
{% endschema %}
